INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "units" VALUES(1009000300,'大蛇','大蛇',3,1,5,0,'10000000000900010','90','g0090u00300','QCX-76A',1,2,1,1,6345,70,806,667,697,3,45683,210,5803,4800,5014,3,58082,267,7378,6102,6375,3,3,1,1,1,1,'自护公国为了实现在敌方主力舰射程外狙击而开发的试作舰队决战砲。装设辅助射出口并长达200m的砲身在喷注电离子团下，可发射输出功率达15万瓩，威力即便是联邦军的麦哲伦级战舰也足以一发击沉的核融合等离子镭射，是相当强的兵器。
在散布米诺夫斯基粒子时，最大有效射程将近300km，其破坏力就算在有效射程边界也普遍认为有大型舰砲的十倍以上，令人期待会获得良好战果。
经「第603技术实验队」在「鲁姆战役」运用实验后，发现此砲所射出的超高温等离子容易受到磁场影响，如果没有间接射击指示就无法准确射击的问题，且由于同时期由军方投入开发，称作「MS」的人型兵器已投入实战，使其实用性未能得证实，从此在往后的战场上未再出现过。','{"id": 1009000300, "hp": 6345, "en": 70, "attack": 806, "defense": 667, "mobility": 697, "movement": 3, "max_hp": 45683, "max_en": 210, "max_attack": 5803, "max_defense": 4800, "max_mobility": 5014, "max_movement": 3, "sp_hp": 8067, "sp_en": 89, "sp_attack": 1025, "sp_defense": 848, "sp_mobility": 886, "sp_movement": 3, "sp_max_hp": 58082, "sp_max_en": 267, "sp_max_attack": 7378, "sp_max_defense": 6102, "sp_max_mobility": 6375, "sp_max_movement": 3}','{"unit_id": 1009000300, "unit_ssp_initial_release_set_id": 1009000300, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1009000300, "unit_ssp_add_status_id": 100002, "unit_ssp_material_consume_set_id": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "stats": {"id": 100002, "ssp_hp": 206, "ssp_en": 1, "ssp_attack": 26, "ssp_defense": 22, "ssp_mobility": 23, "ssp_max_hp": 4119, "ssp_max_en": 19, "ssp_max_attack": 526, "ssp_max_defense": 435, "ssp_max_mobility": 458}, "cores": [{"id": 100900030001, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1009000300, "level": 1, "release_point": 5000, "acquire_item_type_index": 18, "unit_ssp_custom_core_material_set_id": 0, "unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 100900030001, "display_icon_type_index": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "release_condition_custom_core_id": 0, "releases": [{"unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 100900030001, "sort_order": 1, "release_function_type_index": 5, "target_id": 100900030001, "weapon_change": {"id": 100900030001, "before_weapon_id": 0, "after_weapon_id": 100900030090, "weapon": {"id": 100900030090, "name": "核融合等離子鐳射砲 SSP", "type": 1, "tension": 0, "work_type": 0, "main_weapon": 100900030090, "attack_attr": 1, "weapon_attr": 2, "weapon_capability": 1, "weapon_level_up_material": 10021, "weapon_effect": 110004, "ex_short_weapon": 0, "is_full_animation": false, "map_weapon_desc": 0, "map_weapon_range": 0, "map_weapon_trait": 0, "WeaponStatusId": 100900