INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "units" VALUES(1013001200,'阿普萨拉斯Ⅲ','阿普撒拉斯Ⅲ',4,1,4,0,'10000000001300010','130','g0130u01200','-',1,2,1,1,7977,80,925,760,721,4,57433,215,6658,5472,5763,4,63895,240,7407,6088,6411,4,3,3,1,1,1,'阿普撒拉斯开发负责人，自护公国军方技术 少将「基利亚斯‧沙哈连」无视开发中止命 令完成的「阿普撒拉斯最终型」。
在Ⅰ、Ⅱ 型未解决的米诺夫斯基飞行器电力不足问题， 透过搭载3座「力奇‧大魔」用的动力炉获 得解决，还增设两座米诺夫斯基飞行器。
此外，机体下方延展出的三只固定用脚座令 射击时的姿势变得安定，大型MEGA粒子 砲还可利用火力调整造成如多砲门激光砲般 的效果。
经过诸般改进，和过去的阿普撒拉 斯俨然已是不同层级的机体。','{"id": 1013001200, "hp": 7977, "en": 80, "attack": 925, "defense": 760, "mobility": 721, "movement": 4, "max_hp": 57433, "max_en": 215, "max_attack": 6658, "max_defense": 5472, "max_mobility": 5763, "max_movement": 4, "sp_hp": 8875, "sp_en": 89, "sp_attack": 1029, "sp_defense": 846, "sp_mobility": 802, "sp_movement": 4, "sp_max_hp": 63895, "sp_max_en": 240, "sp_max_attack": 7407, "sp_max_defense": 6088, "sp_max_mobility": 6411, "sp_max_movement": 4}','{"unit_id": 1013001200, "unit_ssp_initial_release_set_id": 0, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1013001200, "unit_ssp_add_status_id": 100004, "unit_ssp_material_consume_set_id": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "stats": {"id": 100004, "ssp_hp": 229, "ssp_en": 1, "ssp_attack": 26, "ssp_defense": 22, "ssp_mobility": 21, "ssp_max_hp": 4577, "ssp_max_en": 19, "ssp_max_attack": 526, "ssp_max_defense": 435, "ssp_max_mobility": 412}, "cores": [{"id": 101300120001, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1013001200, "level": 1, "release_point": 5000, "acquire_item_type_index": 18, "unit_ssp_custom_core_material_set_id": 0, "unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 101300120001, "display_icon_type_index": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "release_condition_custom_core_id": 0, "releases": [{"unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 101300120001, "sort_order": 1, "release_function_type_index": 5, "target_id": 101300120001, "weapon_change": {"id": 101300120001, "before_weapon_id": 0, "after_weapon_id": 101300120090, "weapon": {"id": 101300120090, "name": "重型米加粒子砲（單點鐳射） SSP", "type": 1, "tension": 0, "work_type": 0, "main_weapon": 101300120090, "attack_attr": 1, "weapon_attr": 2, "weapon_capability": 1, "weapon_level_up_material": 20022, "weapon_effect": 350032, "ex_short_weapon": 0, "is_full_animation": true, "map_weapon_desc": 0, "map_weapon_range": 0, "map_weapon_trait": 0, "WeaponStatusId": 101300120090, "weapon_status": {"id": 101300120090, "range_min": 1, "range_max": 3, "power": 5100, "en": 64, 