INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "units" VALUES(1022000400,'蓝色命运2号机','苍蓝命运2号机',3,1,2,0,'10000000002200010','220','g0220u00400','RX-79BD-2',1,1,1,1,6997,71,799,668,630,4,50375,190,5751,4810,5036,4,64048,242,7311,6115,6403,4,3,1,3,1,2,'联邦军任命从自护公国的弗拉纳冈机关逃到 地球联邦的「库鲁斯特‧摩杰斯」博士主导 开发称作「EXAM系统」的特殊MS控制 技术下制造的实验用MS2号机，不同于1 号机，在开发初期就是以「陆战型高达」为 基底，所以头部也是高达的头。
基本性能与1号机差异不大，主要的差别是 可使用「镭射步枪」和新加装了宇宙战斗用 装备。
并且此机体也未设定抑制EXAM系统失控 用的限制，系统本身又不完全，所以虽然系 统会因应机体的危险状况而发动，大幅提高 各种能力，但经过特定时间后，系统便会自 动关闭。
本机体是原来的2号机被自护军驾驶员「尼 姆巴斯‧舒特森」抢走后的机体，双肩因搭 乘者尼姆巴斯的喜好而被改涂成红色。','{"id": 1022000400, "hp": 6997, "en": 71, "attack": 799, "defense": 668, "mobility": 630, "movement": 4, "max_hp": 50375, "max_en": 190, "max_attack": 5751, "max_defense": 4810, "max_mobility": 5036, "max_movement": 4, "sp_hp": 8896, "sp_en": 90, "sp_attack": 1016, "sp_defense": 850, "sp_mobility": 801, "sp_movement": 4, "sp_max_hp": 64048, "sp_max_en": 242, "sp_max_attack": 7311, "sp_max_defense": 6115, "sp_max_mobility": 6403, "sp_max_movement": 4}','{"unit_id": 1022000400, "unit_ssp_initial_release_set_id": 1022000400, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1022000400, "unit_ssp_add_status_id": 100004, "unit_ssp_material_consume_set_id": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "stats": {"id": 100004, "ssp_hp": 229, "ssp_en": 1, "ssp_attack": 26, "ssp_defense": 22, "ssp_mobility": 21, "ssp_max_hp": 4577, "ssp_max_en": 19, "ssp_max_attack": 526, "ssp_max_defense": 435, "ssp_max_mobility": 412}, "cores": [{"id": 102200040001, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1022000400, "level": 1, "release_point": 5000, "acquire_item_type_index": 18, "unit_ssp_custom_core_material_set_id": 0, "unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 102200040001, "display_icon_type_index": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "release_condition_custom_core_id": 0, "releases": [{"unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 102200040001, "sort_order": 1, "release_function_type_index": 5, "target_id": 102200040001, "weapon_change": {"id": 102200040001, "before_weapon_id": 0, "after_weapon_id": 102200040090, "weapon": {"id": 102200040090, "name": "EXAM系統 SSP", "type": 1, "tension": 0, "work_type": 0, "main_weapon": 102200040090, "attack_attr": 4, "weapon_attr": 3, "weapon_capability": 1, "weapon_level_up_material": 10021, "weapon_effect": 280011, "ex_short_weapon": 0, "is_full_animation": true, "map_weapon_desc": 0, "map_weapon_range": 0, "map_weapon_trait": 0, "WeaponStatusId": 102200040090, "weapon_status": {"id": 102200040090, "range_min": 1, "range_max"