INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "units" VALUES(1144001700,'NT高达','叙述高达',3,1,2,0,'10000000014401250','1440','g1440u01700','RX-9',1,1,1,1,6965,71,812,665,628,5,50148,190,5841,4784,5018,5,63760,241,7426,6083,6380,5,3,1,3,1,2,'主角约拿‧巴斯塔所驾驶的MS，由阿纳海姆电子公司制造。
原本是在RX-93 ν高达之前所开发的精神感应框体试验机。
特征是各部位都没有装甲，使机体内部的框体外曝。
由于本来是试验机，因此机体本身的武装只有头部火神砲，但在「狩猎不死鸟」行动中借助月球商会之力，得以更换多种武装来运用。','{"id": 1144001700, "hp": 6965, "en": 71, "attack": 812, "defense": 665, "mobility": 628, "movement": 5, "max_hp": 50148, "max_en": 190, "max_attack": 5841, "max_defense": 4784, "max_mobility": 5018, "max_movement": 5, "sp_hp": 8856, "sp_en": 90, "sp_attack": 1032, "sp_defense": 845, "sp_mobility": 798, "sp_movement": 5, "sp_max_hp": 63760, "sp_max_en": 241, "sp_max_attack": 7426, "sp_max_defense": 6083, "sp_max_mobility": 6380, "sp_max_movement": 5}','{"unit_id": 1144001700, "unit_ssp_initial_release_set_id": 1144001700, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1144001700, "unit_ssp_add_status_id": 100004, "unit_ssp_material_consume_set_id": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "stats": {"id": 100004, "ssp_hp": 229, "ssp_en": 1, "ssp_attack": 26, "ssp_defense": 22, "ssp_mobility": 21, "ssp_max_hp": 4577, "ssp_max_en": 19, "ssp_max_attack": 526, "ssp_max_defense": 435, "ssp_max_mobility": 412}, "cores": [{"id": 114400170001, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1144001700, "level": 1, "release_point": 5000, "acquire_item_type_index": 18, "unit_ssp_custom_core_material_set_id": 0, "unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 114400170001, "display_icon_type_index": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "release_condition_custom_core_id": 0, "releases": [{"unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 114400170001, "sort_order": 1, "release_function_type_index": 5, "target_id": 114400170001, "weapon_change": {"id": 114400170001, "before_weapon_id": 0, "after_weapon_id": 114400170090, "weapon": {"id": 114400170090, "name": "鐳射軍刀 SSP", "type": 1, "tension": 0, "work_type": 0, "main_weapon": 114400170090, "attack_attr": 2, "weapon_attr": 2, "weapon_capability": 1, "weapon_level_up_material": 10021, "weapon_effect": 240002, "ex_short_weapon": 0, "is_full_animation": true, "map_weapon_desc": 0, "map_weapon_range": 0, "map_weapon_trait": 0, "WeaponStatusId": 114400170090, "weapon_status": {"id": 114400170090, "range_min": 1, "range_max"