INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "units" VALUES(1850001650,'伟大·吉翁号 (EX)','伟大‧自护号 (EX)',5,3,30,0,'10000000085000010','8500','g8500u01650','MSN-03-2',1,1,1,1,9459,101,1045,955,1054,5,68100,317,7523,6872,7226,5,68100,317,7523,6872,7226,5,3,3,3,1,2,'自护公国的脑波传导搭载型MS「自护号」的后继机，是为了打造究极MS而特别设计的机体群之一。
进一步改良有线控制式脑波传导系统的全方位攻击，使其可以借由分离头部、胸部、腰部、两腕、两脚七个部位进行无线遥控以发动全方位攻击，并于两肩的支架搭载米诺夫斯基推进器，以便能在大气圈内运用，可说是具备了够格称为自护号后继机的高性能。
虽然在开发计划书告一段落时战争便已结束，使得本机没有实际被建造出来，但其设计资料后来传至阿古捷斯，成了次世代机的基础。','{"id": 1850001650, "hp": 9459, "en": 101, "attack": 1045, "defense": 955, "mobility": 1054, "movement": 5, "max_hp": 68100, "max_en": 317, "max_attack": 7523, "max_defense": 6872, "max_mobility": 7226, "max_movement": 5, "sp_hp": 9459, "sp_en": 101, "sp_attack": 1045, "sp_defense": 955, "sp_mobility": 1054, "sp_movement": 5, "sp_max_hp": 68100, "sp_max_en": 317, "sp_max_attack": 7523, "sp_max_defense": 6872, "sp_max_mobility": 7226, "sp_max_movement": 5}','null','偉大‧自護號 (EX)','scrape',1791488368,'v2026.10.08',1850001501);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "units" VALUES(1850001800,'卡碧尼原型机','卡碧尼原型机',3,2,2,0,'10000850008000810','8500','g8500u01800','AMX-001',1,1,1,1,8050,60,665,812,625,5,57960,189,4788,5843,4250,5,73692,241,6088,7429,5404,5,3,1,3,1,2,'于PS《SD高达G世代F》登场。
以爱美号的MS化为目标，于阿古捷斯进行开发的试作MS。
由于当时技术难以将脑波传导系统小型化，最后成为一架巨大的机体。','{"id": 1850001800, "hp": 8050, "en": 60, "attack": 665, "defense": 812, "mobility": 625, "movement": 5, "max_hp": 57960, "max_en": 189, "max_attack": 4788, "max_defense": 5843, "max_mobility": 4250, "max_movement": 5, "sp_hp": 10235, "sp_en": 76, "sp_attack": 846, "sp_defense": 1032, "sp_mobility": 795, "sp_movement": 5, "sp_max_hp": 73692, "sp_max_en": 241, "sp_max_attack": 6088, "sp_max_defense": 7429, "sp_max_mobility": 5404, "sp_max_movement": 5}','{"unit_id": 1850001800, "unit_ssp_initial_release_set_id": 1850001800, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1850001800, "unit_ssp_add_status_id": 100010, "unit_ssp_material_consume_set_id": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "stats": {"id": 100010, "ssp_hp": 263, "ssp_en": 1, "ssp_attack": 22, "ssp_defense": 26, "ssp_mobility": 21, "ssp_max_hp": 5264, "ssp_max_en": 16, "ssp_max_attack": 435, "ssp_max_defense": 526, "ssp_max_mobility": 412}, "cores": [{"id": 185000180001, "unit_ssp_custom_core_group_id": 1850001800, "level": 1, "release_point": 5000, "acquire_item_type_index": 18, "unit_ssp_custom_core_material_set_id": 0, "unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 185000180001, "display_icon_type_index": 1, "schedule_id": 2511209901, "release_condition_custom_core_id": 0, "releases": [{"unit_ssp_custom_core_release_function_set_id": 185000180001, "sort_order": 1, "release_function_type_index": 5, "target_id": 185000180001, "weapon_change": {"id": 185000180001, "before_weapon_id": 0, "after_weapon_id": 185000180090, "weapon": {"id": 185000180090, "name": "感應砲 SSP", "type": 1, "tension": 0, "work_type": 0, "main_weapon": 185000180090, "attack_attr": 3, "weapon_attr": 3, "weapon_capability": 1, "weapon_level_up_material": 10021, "weapon_effect": 340020, "ex_short_weapon": 0, "is_full_animation": false, "map_weapon_desc": 0, "map_weapon_range": 0, "map_weapon_trait": 0, "WeaponStatusId": 185000180090, "weapon_status": {"id": 185000180090, "range_min": 2, "range_max": 5, "power": 4900, "en": 6